<title>USA: FMR group cuts NYNEX CableComms stake.</title>
<headline>FMR group cuts NYNEX CableComms stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp, the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds, said Wednesday it reduced its stake in NYNEX CableComms Group to 4.94 percent or 305,850 American Depositary Receipts.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the net sale of 178,100 ADRs of NYNEX CableComms between August 6 and September 9 at prices ranging from $13.25 to $16.50 an ADR.</p>
</text>
